  "descriptions": [
   {
    "text": "Premier High-Floor Living @ Telok Blangah Towers\nElevate your lifestyle in this stunning Premium Apartment at 80A Telok Blangah Street 31.\n\n This 1,022 sqft (95 sqm) home offers modern design and unbeatable convenience in the heart of Bukit Merah.\n\nProperty Highlights\n• Spacious & Functional: Squarish 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom layout, perfect for modern families.\n• Young Lease: Completed in 2013, offering a healthy remaining lease of approximately 86 years—a rare find in this mature estate.\n• Skyscraper Views: Located in a prestigious 38-storey development; enjoy the breeze and potential city or greenery views from a high floor.\nUnbeatable Connectivity & Amenities\n• Walk to MRT: Just 440m to Labrador Park MRT (Circle Line) and close to Telok Blangah MRT, making your island-wide commute effortless.\n• Grocery Haven: Steps away from FairPrice (270m) and HAO Mart (290m) for all your daily essentials.\n• Retail Therapy: A short stroll to Alexandra Retail Centre (ARC) for dining, shopping, and entertainment.\n• Top Schools nearby: Within 1km of Blangah Rise Primary School and close to ISS International School.\nActive Lifestyle & Community\n• On-site Facilities: Direct access to a sheltered car park, modern playground, and fitness corners.\n• Nature at Your Doorstep: Proximity to the Southern Ridges and Labrador Nature Reserve for weekend hikes and outdoor relaxation.",
